st, this game turns your open room into a dynamic playground where entertainment meets physical fitness.\nStart with engaging target practice:\n- \ud83c\udfaf Hit spawning square boxes with precision throws.\n- \ud83e\udd6b Knock down stacked cans in pyramid formations.\n- \u2b55 Launch balls through glowing circles that appear in your space.\n- \ud83e\udd86 Test your reflexes with rotating glowing ducks\u2014hit only the right ones to score big!\nOnce you\u2019ve mastered the challenges, the real battle begins. Tiny, playful creatures with spatial awareness spawn in your room, hiding behind furniture and teasing you with surprise attacks. Stay agile\u2014jump, dodge, and move to avoid being hit, then grab balls and strike back to win!\nRoom Raider is more than just a game\u2014it\u2019s a fun, engaging workout that blends entertainment with fitness. Perfect for players of all ages, it transforms your everyday environment into an immersive arena where skill, speed, and strategy collide.\n", "short_description": "Step into Room Raider, a thrilling mixed reality game by ShemarooVerse Digital Limited. Transform your living space into an action-packed arena where you throw, dodge, and score against dynamic targets and mischievous creatures. Fun, fitness, and immersive gameplay\u2014all in your own room!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.shemarooverse.com/en/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ShemarooVerse Digital Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.shemarooverse.com/en", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_g